<title>USA: No bids for surplus U.S. vegetable tannin.</title>
<headline>No bids for surplus U.S. vegetable tannin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile said Thursday it received no bids for surplus vegetable tannins during its monthly offering.</p>
<p>Next bid opening was set for October 16 at 1000 Eastern. Tannins are offered on the third Wednesday of each month.</p>
